{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9255468554539979", "organization": {"id": "507522378848494", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "9255468554539979"}]}, "id": "1209502533948113"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "9255468554539979", "release_date": 1766052060, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27172937469033146"}, "id": "613933868138295"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1781883968, "id": "27118215204505373", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v9", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 9, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "27118347467825480"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "9255468554539979"}, "id": "27118347467825480", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "9255468554539979", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "775703728690518"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2886682061669161", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dance Guru", "keywords": ["Salsa", "Tanzen", "Lehrer", "T\u00e4nzer"], "long_description": "# Social Dance Lektionen \nTauche ein in die Mixed Reality und lerne in deinem eigenen Tempo mit Schritt-f\u00fcr-Schritt-Anleitungen durch Lektionen verschiedener Tanzstile, wie z.B. Walzer, Cha-cha, Salsa und Bachata. \u00dcbe so oft du m\u00f6chtest und wiederhole Lektionen, bis du dich sicher f\u00fchlst. Entdecke die Freude am Gesellschafts- und Social Dance, bequem von zu Hause aus. Die Anf\u00e4ngerlektionen sind kostenlos und fortgeschrittene Lektionen werden als IAP im Laufe des ersten und zweiten Quartals 2026 ver\u00f6ffentlicht. {1201573105476690}  \n# Virtueller Tanzpartner \nDein virtueller Tanzpartner ist immer f\u00fcr dich da, begleitet jede Lektion, \u00fcbt an deiner Seite und hilft dir, jede Routine zu meistern. Mit nat\u00fcrlicher Handinteraktion kannst du sie in Chasse Schritte, elegante Turns und mehr f\u00fchren. {1412805003086976}\n# Wettbewerbe und Belohnungen \nSobald du bereit bist, stelle deine F\u00e4higkeiten in schillernden Wettbewerben im Stil von \u201eDancing with the Stars\u201c unter Beweis. Verdiene dir Punkte von virtuellen Juroren, erklimme die globalen Bestenlisten und schalte Belohnungen frei, um eine Garderobe mit eleganten Kleidern und Kost\u00fcmen aufzubauen, die dich auf deinen n\u00e4chsten gro\u00dfen Tanz vorbereiten. \n{2393855267710631}\n# Bachata Bronze Lektionen-Paket Update! \nWir haben gerade den Bachata Bronze Kurs ver\u00f6ffentlicht, mit 11 essentiellen Tanzfiguren und 9 Routinen~ Hol dir jetzt den Einf\u00fchrungs-Sonderrabatt!  \n{1238225715083736}\n# Tritt unserem Discord bei und hilf uns, uns zu verbessern!\nhttps://dsc.gg/danceguru", "short_description": "Dance Guru ist eine Mixed Reality Tanzplattform, die neu erfindet, wie Menschen Gesellschaftstanz lernen und genie\u00dfen, mit einem virtuellen Partner, der jederzeit und \u00fcberall bereit ist, mit dir zu tanzen."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2674777702923012", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dance Guru", "keywords": ["Baila", "salsa", "bailar\u00edn/bailarina"], "long_description": "# Lecciones de Baile Social \nEntra a la realidad mixta y aprende a tu propio ritmo con gu\u00eda paso a paso a trav\u00e9s de lecciones de varios estilos de baile, tales como Waltz, Cha-cha, Salsa y Bachata. Practica tan seguido como quieras y repite las lecciones hasta que te sientas seguro. Descubre la alegr\u00eda del baile de sal\u00f3n y social, desde la comodidad de tu propio hogar. Las lecciones para principiantes son gratuitas y las lecciones avanzadas se lanzar\u00e1n como IAP durante el primer y segundo trimestre de 2026.{916391887795572}\n# Pareja de Baile Virtual \nTu Pareja de Baile Virtual siempre est\u00e1 ah\u00ed para ti, guiando cada lecci\u00f3n, practicando a tu lado y ayud\u00e1ndote a dominar cada rutina. Con la interacci\u00f3n natural de las manos, puedes guiarla a pasos Chasse, giros elegantes y m\u00e1s. {1401964711077704}\n# Competiciones y Recompensas \nUna vez que est\u00e9s listo, pon tus habilidades a prueba en deslumbrantes competiciones al estilo de \"Bailando con las Estrellas\". Obt\u00e9n puntuaciones de jueces virtuales, asciende en las tablas de clasificaci\u00f3n global y desbloquea recompensas para construir un guardarropa de vestidos y disfraces elegantes, prepar\u00e1ndote para tu pr\u00f3ximo gran baile. {1540246433732795}\n# \u00a1Actualizaci\u00f3n del Paquete de Lecciones Bachata Bronce!\nAcabamos de lanzar el curso de Bachata Bronce, con 11 figuras de baile esenciales y 9 rutinas. \u00a1Obt\u00e9n ahora el Descuento Especial de Lanzamiento!  {1954301138856622}\n# Discord \nhttps://dsc.gg/danceguru\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Dance Guru es una plataforma de baile de Realidad Mixta que est\u00e1 reinventando c\u00f3mo la gente aprende y disfruta el baile social, con una pareja virtual lista para bailar contigo en cualquier momento y en cualquier lugar."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2148312715736594", "locale": "zh_TW", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dance Guru", "keywords": ["\u8df3\u821e", "\u838e\u838e", "\u821e", "\u5c0e\u5e2b", "\u821e\u8005"], "long_description": "\n# \u793e\u4ea4\u821e\u8ab2\u7a0b\n\u8e0f\u5165\u6df7\u5408\u5be6\u5883\uff0c\u6309\u7167\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u6b65\u8abf\uff0c\u900f\u904e\u5404\u7a2e\u821e\u6b65\u98a8\u683c\u7684\u9010\u6b65\u6307\u5c0e\u5b78\u7fd2\uff0c\u4f8b\u5982 Waltz\u3001Cha-cha\u3001Salsa \u548c Bachata\u3002 \u96a8\u5fc3\u6240\u6b32\u5730\u7df4\u7fd2\uff0c\u4e26\u91cd\u8907\u8ab2\u7a0b\u76f4\u5230\u60a8\u611f\u5230\u81ea\u4fe1\u3002 \u5f9e\u8212\u9069\u7684\u5bb6\u4e2d\u958b\u59cb\uff0c\u63a2\u7d22\u4ea4\u8abc\u821e\u548c\u793e\u4ea4\u821e\u7684\u6a02\u8da3\u3002 \u521d\u5b78\u8005\u8ab2\u7a0b\u662f\u514d\u8cbb\u7684\uff0c\u9032\u968e\u8ab2\u7a0b\u5c07\u65bc 2026 \u5e74\u7b2c\u4e00\u5b63\u5ea6\u548c\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5b63\u5ea6\u900f\u904e\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f\u5167\u8cfc\u8cb7 (IAP) \u767c\u5e03\u3002 {903250616004425}\n# \u865b\u64ec\u821e\u4f34\n\u60a8\u7684\u865b\u64ec\u821e\u4f34\u96a8\u6642\u70ba\u60a8\u670d\u52d9\uff0c\u6307\u5c0e\u6bcf\u7bc0\u8ab2\u3001\u5728\u60a8\u8eab\u908a\u7df4\u7fd2\uff0c\u4e26\u5e6b\u52a9\u60a8\u638c\u63e1\u6bcf\u500b\u5957\u8def\u3002 \u900f\u904e\u81ea\u7136\u7684\u624b\u90e8\u4e92\u52d5\uff0c\u60a8\u53ef\u4ee5\u5f15\u5c0e\u5979\u9032\u5165 Chasse steps\u3001\u512a\u96c5\u7684 Turns \u7b49\u3002 {4233522050244236}\n# \u6bd4\u8cfd\u8207\u734e\u52f5 \n\u4e00\u65e6\u60a8\u6e96\u5099\u597d\u4e86\uff0c\u5c31\u5728\u4ee4\u4eba\u773c\u82b1\u64a9\u4e82\u7684\u300c\u8207\u661f\u5171\u821e\u300d\u98a8\u683c\u6bd4\u8cfd\u4e2d\u6e2c\u8a66\u60a8\u7684\u6280\u80fd\u3002 \u5f9e\u865b\u64ec\u8a55\u5be9\u90a3\u88e1\u7372\u5f97\u5206\u6578\uff0c\u767b\u4e0a\u5168\u7403\u6392\u884c\u699c\uff0c\u4e26\u89e3\u9396\u734e\u52f5\uff0c\u6253\u9020\u4e00\u500b\u512a\u96c5\u79ae\u670d\u548c\u670d\u88dd\u7684\u8863\u6ae5\uff0c\u70ba\u60a8\u7684\u4e0b\u4e00\u6b21\u5927\u578b\u821e\u8e48\u505a\u6e96\u5099\u3002 {937898349187307}\n# Bachata Bronze \u8ab2\u7a0b\u5305\u66f4\u65b0\uff01\n\u6211\u5011\u525b\u525b\u767c\u5e03\u4e86 Bachata Bronze \u8ab2\u7a0b\uff0c\u5305\u542b 11 \u500b\u57fa\u790e\u821e\u6b65\u548c 9 \u500b\u5957\u8def\uff5e \u73fe\u5728\u5c31\u7372\u53d6\u767c\u5e03\u512a\u60e0\u6298\u6263\uff01 {1245221657569396} \n# \u734e\u9805\u8207\u69ae\u8b7d \n- 2024 \u5e74 Meta Presence Platform \u9ed1\u5ba2\u677e\u7af6\u8cfd\u51a0\u8ecd \n- 2025 \u5e74 Meta Start Lifestyle RFP \u734e\u52a9\u91d1\u7372\u5f97\u8005 \n- 2025 \u5e74 Unity \u53f0\u7063\u7279\u5225\u734e\u5f97\u4e3b  \n# \u52a0\u5165\u6211\u5011\u7684 Discord \u4e26\u5e6b\u52a9\u6211\u5011\u6539\u9032\uff01 https://dsc.gg/danceguru\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Dance Guru \u662f\u4e00\u500b\u6df7\u5408\u5be6\u5883\u821e\u8e48\u5e73\u53f0\uff0c\u6b63\u5728\u91cd\u65b0\u69cb\u60f3\u4eba\u5011\u5b78\u7fd2\u548c\u4eab\u53d7\u793e\u4ea4\u821e\u8e48\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\uff0c\u5b83\u63d0\u4f9b\u4e00\u500b\u865b\u64ec\u821e\u4f34\uff0c\u96a8\u6642\u96a8\u5730\u6e96\u5099\u597d\u8207\u60a8\u5171\u821e\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2061425328108992", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dance Guru", "keywords": ["\u30c0\u30f3\u30b9", "\u30b5\u30eb\u30b5", "\u30c0\u30f3\u30b7\u30f3\u30b0", "\u6307\u5c0e\u8005", "\u30c0\u30f3\u30b5\u30fc"], "long_description": "# \u30bd\u30fc\u30b7\u30e3\u30eb\u30c0\u30f3\u30b9\u30ec\u30c3\u30b9\u30f3 \n\u8907\u5408\u73fe\u5b9f\uff08MR\uff09\u306b\u8db3\u3092\u8e0f\u307f\u5165\u308c\u3001\u30ef\u30eb\u30c4\u3001\u30c1\u30e3\u30c1\u30e3\u3001\u30b5\u30eb\u30b5\u3001\u30d0\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u30bf\u306a\u3069\u3001\u69d8\u3005\u306a\u30c0\u30f3\u30b9\u30b9\u30bf\u30a4\u30eb\u306e\u30ec\u30c3\u30b9\u30f3\u3092\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u30d0\u30a4\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u30ac\u30a4\u30c0\u30f3\u30b9\u3067\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b9\u3067\u5b66\u3073\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\u7d0d\u5f97\u304c\u3044\u304f\u307e\u3067\u4f55\u5ea6\u3067\u3082\u7df4\u7fd2\u3057\u3001\u30ec\u30c3\u30b9\u30f3\u3092\u7e70\u308a\u8fd4\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\