=00_AQCUBrtuqhppX8anqasg7HJJsW6KbFNJJDkPj7pP9tYPwA&oe=6A4D0956"}, {"file_name": "Trailer New_2026_02.png", "id": "1675700103577898", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619805_1675700110244564_6312679915018259361_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E9S9O-FXE1QQ7kNvwGrq1Hs&_nc_oc=AdrPjqUTRZkFS6oRSKfh-8-TEdd9sa5dw0MtT6FbZ6loyKqdy2oT-hcR-zrSAU6qEp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQADc1Fv3cKRE5c53Fu9uHbuW3XYhlZT_PuKmadb2Pko0A&oe=6A4CF813"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_costume.png", "id": "27965749506361249", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585741071_27965749516361248_7933758749741725322_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xIzjavy8ypwQ7kNvwHvUorW&_nc_oc=Adp1I7jebVEkLCumi04wqtMuyXeb5McmL1KsXU3lwznIFIeDm3H2CviFLeM5zyodr7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA-e48ZApDOAzEFipStsBnBT24VGoVGkLCa7t4ReCgH8Q&oe=6A4CEFEC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "DanceGuru_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "979396178038443", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_979396184705109_4232970055550354742_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=frmJwjapIpIQ7kNvwExYekK&_nc_oc=AdoSfh2RxEa4MKex4uDElNofo8eyCiumEFRC3BhVdOUTM5QqYI2yxnqx1ud0vkvIyCg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD0LaJD_11aBr7-YBlAo6j9PlwxgVvDopw09Cy4XlFeAA&oe=6A4CEE0E"}, "display_name": "Dance Guru", "keywords": ["dance", "salsa", "dancing", "guru", "dancer"], "long_description": "# Social Dance Lessons\nStep into mixed reality and learn at your own pace with step-by-step guidance through lessons of various dance styles, such as Waltz, Cha-cha, Salsa and Bachata.  Practice as often as you like, and repeat lessons until you feel confident. Discover the joy of ballroom and social dancing, right from the comfort of your own home.  Start with free basic lessons, then unlock advanced lessons through in-app purchases. {1426343328996956}\n# Virtual Dance Partner\nYour Virtual Dance Partner is always there for you, guiding each lesson, practicing by your side, and helping you master every routine. With natural hand interaction, you can lead her into chasse steps, graceful turns, and more. \n{1026458989727925}\n# Competitions and Rewards\nOnce you\u2019re ready, put your skills to the test in dazzling \u201cDancing with the Stars\u201d\u2013style competitions. Earn scores from virtual judges, climb the global leaderboards, and unlock rewards to build a wardrobe of elegant dresses and costumes, preparing you for your next big dance. {1969260873970721}\n# Salsa Bronze Lesson Pack Update!\nThe Salsa Bronze course is finally here, with 11 essential dance figures and 9 routines! {1033129242478205}\n# Awards & Recognitions\n- Winner of Meta Presence Platform Hackathon 2024\n- Meta Start Lifestyle RFP Grant Recipient 2025\n- Winner of Unity Taiwan Special Award 2025  \n# Join our Discord and help us improve! \nhttps://dsc.gg/danceguru", "short_description": "Dance Guru is a Mixed Reality Dance Platform that's reimagining how people learn and enjoy social dancing, with a virtual partner ready to dance with you anytime, anywhere."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1009838312018782", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dance Guru", "keywords": ["Balla", "salsa", "ballare", "maestro"], "long_description": " \n# Lezioni di Ballo Sociale \nEntra nella realt\u00e0 mista e impara al tuo ritmo con una guida passo passo attraverso lezioni di vari stili di ballo, come Valzer, Cha-cha, Salsa e Bachata. Esercitati tutte le volte che vuoi e ripeti le lezioni finch\u00e9 non ti senti sicuro. Scopri la gioia del ballo da sala e del ballo sociale, direttamente dalla comodit\u00e0 di casa tua. Le lezioni per principianti sono gratuite e le lezioni avanzate verranno rilasciate come IAP tra il Q1 e il Q2 del 2026. {723881107328189}  \n# Partner di Ballo Virtuale \nIl tuo Partner di Ballo Virtuale \u00e8 sempre l\u00ec per te, guidandoti in ogni lezione, esercitandosi al tuo fianco e aiutandoti a padroneggiare ogni routine. Con l'interazione naturale della mano, puoi guidarla in passi Chasse, aggraziate piroette e altro ancora. {1577744797008278}\n# Competizioni e Ricompense \nQuando sarai pronto, metti alla prova le tue abilit\u00e0 in incredibili competizioni in stile \"Dancing with the Stars\". Ottieni punteggi da giudici virtuali, scala le classifiche globali e sblocca ricompense per costruire un guardaroba di abiti e costumi eleganti, preparandoti per il tuo prossimo grande ballo. Ad esempio, esegui un BoxStep o un BasicSide, e poi un' Alemana! {944987944772018}\n# Aggiornamento Pacchetto Lezione Bronzo Bachata! \nAbbiamo appena rilasciato il corso Bronzo Bachata, con 11 figure di ballo essenziali e 9 routine~ Ottieni subito lo Sconto Speciale di Lancio! {1618241565878686}\n# Unisciti al nostro Discord e aiutaci a migliorare!\nhttps://dsc.gg/danceguru", "short_description": "Dance Guru \u00e8 una piattaforma di danza in Realt\u00e0 Mista che sta reinventando il modo in cui le persone imparano e si divertono con il ballo sociale, con un partner virtuale pronto a ballare con te quando e dove vuoi."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "950561901347422", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dance Guru", "keywords": ["\ucda4", "\uc0b4\uc0ac", "\ub304\uc2f1", "\ub304\uc11c"], "long_description": "\n# \uc18c\uc15c \ub304\uc2a4 \ub808\uc2a8 \ud63c\ud569 \ud604\uc2e4 \n\uc18d\uc73c\ub85c \ub4e4\uc5b4\uac00 \uc648\uce20, \ucc28\ucc28\ucc28, \uc0b4\uc0ac, \ubc14\ucc28\ud0c0 \ub4f1 \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \ub304\uc2a4 \uc2a4\ud0c0\uc77c\uc758 \ub808\uc2a8\uc744 \ub2e8\uacc4\ubcc4 \uac00\uc774\ub4dc\uc5d0 \ub530\ub77c \uc790\uc2e0\ub9cc\uc758 \uc18d\ub3c4\ub85c \ubc30\uc6b0\uc138\uc694. \uc790\uc2e0\uac10\uc774 \uc0dd\uae38 \ub54c\uae4c\uc9c0 \uc6d0\ud558\ub294 \ub9cc\ud07c \uc5f0\uc2b5\ud558\uace0 \ub808\uc2a8\uc744 \ubc18\ubcf5\ud558\uc138\uc694. \uc9d1\uc5d0\uc11c \ud3b8\uc548\ud558\uac8c \ubcfc\ub8f8 \ubc0f \uc18c\uc15c \ub304\uc2a4\uc758 \uc990\uac70\uc6c0\uc744 \ubc1c\uacac\ud558\uc138\uc694. \ucd08\uae09 \ub808\uc2a8\uc740 \ubb34\ub8cc\uc774\uba70 \uace0\uae09 \ub808\uc2a8\uc740 2026\ub144 1\ubd84\uae30 \ubc0f 2\ubd84\uae30\uc5d0 IAP\ub85c \ucd9c\uc2dc\ub420 \uc608\uc815\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \n{938050565350097}\n# \uac00\uc0c1 \ub304\uc2a4 \ud30c\ud2b8\ub108 \n\uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84\uc758 \uac00\uc0c1 \ub304\uc2a4 \ud30c\ud2b8\ub108\ub294 \ud56d\uc0c1 \uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84 \uacc1\uc5d0\uc11c \uac01 \ub808\uc2a8\uc744 \uc548\ub0b4\ud558\uace0, \ud568\uaed8 \uc5f0\uc2b5\ud558\uba70, \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ub8e8\ud2f4\uc744 \ub9c8\uc2a4\ud130\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub3c4\ub85d \ub3c4\uc640\uc90d\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc790\uc5f0\uc2a4\ub7ec\uc6b4 \uc190 \uc0c1\ud638 \uc791\uc6a9\uc73c\ub85c \uc0e4\uc138 \uc2a4\ud15d, \uc6b0\uc544\ud55c \ud134 \ub4f1\uc73c\ub85c \uadf8\ub140\ub97c \ub9ac\ub4dc\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \n{2391443261303847}\n# \ub300\ud68c \ubc0f \ubcf4\uc0c1 \n\uc900\ube44\uac00\ub418\uba74 \ud654\ub824\ud55c \"Dancing with the Stars\" \uc2a4\ud0c0\uc77c\uc758 \ub300\ud68c\uc5d0\uc11c \uc2e4\ub825\uc744 \uc2dc\ud5d8\ud574 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694. \uac00\uc0c1 \uc2ec\uc0ac\uc704\uc6d0\uc73c\ub85c\ubd80\ud130 \uc810\uc218\ub97c \uc5bb\uace0, \uae00\ub85c\ubc8c \ub9ac\ub354\ubcf4\ub4dc\uc5d0 \uc62c\ub77c \uc6b0\uc544\ud55c \ub4dc\ub808\uc2a4\uc640 \uc758\uc0c1\uc73c\ub85c \uc637\uc7a5\uc744 \ucc44\uc6b8 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \ubcf4\uc0c1\uc744 \ubc1b\uc544 \ub2e4\uc74c \ud070 \ucda4\uc744 \uc900\ube44\ud558\uc138\uc694. {790279450149195}\n# \ubc14\ucc28\ud0c0 \ube0c\ub860\uc988 \ub808\uc2a8 \ud329 \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8!\n11\uac00\uc9c0 \ud544\uc218 \ub304\uc2a4 \ud53c\uaca8\uc640 9\uac00\uc9c0 \ub8e8\ud2f4\uc73c\ub85c \uad6c\uc131\ub41c \ubc14\ucc28\ud0c0 \ube0c\ub860\uc988 \ucf54\uc2a4\ub97c \ucd9c\uc2dc\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4~ \uc9c0\uae08 \ub7f0\uce6d \ud2b9\ubcc4 \ud560\uc778\uc744 \ubc1b\uc73c\uc138\uc694!{2323276131470463}\n\n# \uc218\uc0c1 \ubc0f \uc778\uc815 \n- Meta Presence Platform Hackathon 2024 \uc6b0\uc2b9 \n- Meta Start Lifestyle RFP Grant \uc218\uc0c1 2025 \n- Unity Taiwan Special Award 2025 \uc6b0\uc2b9  \n# Discord\uc5d0 \ucc38\uc5ec\ud558\uc5ec \uac1c\uc120\uc5d0 \ub3c4\uc6c0\uc744 \uc8fc\uc138\uc694! \nhttps://dsc.gg/danceguru", "short_description": "Dance Guru\ub294 \ud63c\ud569 \ud604\uc2e4 \ub304\uc2a4 \ud50c\ub7ab\ud3fc\uc73c\ub85c, \uc0ac\ub78c\ub4e4\uc774 \uc18c\uc15c \ub304\uc2a4\ub97c \ubc30\uc6b0\uace0 \uc990\uae30\ub294 \ubc29\uc2dd\uc744 \uc7ac\ud574\uc11d\ud558\uc5ec \uc5b8\uc81c \uc5b4\ub514\uc11c\ub4e0 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uacfc \ud568\uaed8 \ucda4\ucd9c \uc900\ube44\uac00 \ub41c \uac00\uc0c1 \ud30c\ud2b8\ub108\ub97c \uc81c\uacf5\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."}]}, "developer_name": "Hypercreative Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hypercreative.games/danceguru-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hypercreative Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hypercreative.games/danceguru", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_TW", "zh_CN", "fr_BE", "fr_CA", "fr", "es", "es_VE", "es_PR", "es_PE", "es_MX", "es_CO", "es_CL", "es_AR", "it", "ko", "ja", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_mo